WEBVTT

00:00.007 --> 00:01.175
THIS IS A WORK OF FICTION. UNDERAGE
DRINKING IS STRONGLY PROHIBITED.

00:01.175 --> 00:02.468
FORCEFUL ALCOHOL CONSUMPTION, BINGE
DRINKING, SHAMEFUL ACTS NOT ENCOURAGED.

00:02.468 --> 00:03.761
VIEW THIS AS A COMEDY. ALL CHARACTERS
APPEARING IN THIS WORK ARE OF LEGAL AGE.

00:03.761 --> 00:04.970
DUE TO RECENT COMPLIANCE ISSUES, THE
BLACK DOT SIZE HAS BEEN INCREASED BY 5%.

00:05.199 --> 00:07.306
Could it be... you feel
that
way about Kitahara?

00:12.603 --> 00:13.520
There's...

00:14.146 --> 00:15.856
There is no such thing.

00:16.303 --> 00:17.441
Really?

00:17.775 --> 00:21.153
Seriously, why would you say
something like that out of nowhere?

00:21.278 --> 00:22.655
Did you drink too much?

00:22.738 --> 00:25.407
I already told you,
if I don't get it, I'm sorry.

00:25.407 --> 00:27.368
No, there is nothing like that at all!

00:27.765 --> 00:30.262
Well, I'm going to bed
to get ready for tomorrow.

00:30.287 --> 00:31.038
Good night.

00:31.038 --> 00:32.790
Yeah, good night.

00:50.182 --> 00:52.601
Let's go take a trip
under the bright summer sun

00:52.601 --> 00:55.854
GRAND BLUE DREAMING SEASON 3
To a city far away, what do you say?

00:55.854 --> 00:58.232
Let's go take a trip
under the bright summer sun

00:58.232 --> 01:01.777
To a city far away, what do you say?

01:05.906 --> 01:07.741
Wait a sec, another heatwave?

01:07.741 --> 01:09.493
Temperatures are rising... Huh?!

01:09.493 --> 01:12.705
Our original plans are
totally busted, what now?

01:12.705 --> 01:15.499
But honestly, I'm getting so hyped

01:15.499 --> 01:18.168
Alright, let's roll up
our sleeves and dive in

01:18.168 --> 01:19.962
Rub your sleepy eyes and jump up

01:19.962 --> 01:21.380
Grab the usual shades

01:21.380 --> 01:24.300
Check your gear: Iced coffee, thermos

01:24.300 --> 01:26.969
Clear blue skies, just a trick of summer

01:26.969 --> 01:30.097
The booming speakers
keep calling my name

01:30.472 --> 01:32.975
Even now, I still believe

01:35.894 --> 01:37.855
In unexpected encounters

01:37.855 --> 01:40.399
And the miracles of this season

01:40.399 --> 01:43.694
Summer brings
those swing swing emotions

01:43.694 --> 01:46.447
Ah, even if I get a little carried away

01:46.447 --> 01:51.619
On my mind,
I've only been searching for you

01:51.619 --> 01:57.583
Let the south wind blow you here,
just as you are

01:57.583 --> 02:02.296
Under the blue sky, hold me tight

02:03.088 --> 02:08.552
I want to dream
a summer dream with you

02:09.386 --> 02:11.430
- Good morning.
- Good morning.

02:12.306 --> 02:14.224
You guys look pretty worn out.

02:14.224 --> 02:15.768
Yeah...

02:15.768 --> 02:17.227
We're tired from yesterday.

02:17.478 --> 02:19.438
CONGRATS!! DOLPHIN IS ON TV TODAY
Now then, according to today's schedule,

02:19.438 --> 02:21.106
CONGRATS!! DOLPHIN IS ON TV TODAY
we have a TV interview.

02:21.106 --> 02:22.608
- Oh!
- Oh!

02:23.537 --> 02:25.527
Just pre-opening
and we're already getting one?

02:25.527 --> 02:28.030
The shop must be
getting a lot of attention.

02:28.030 --> 02:29.448
Not at all.

02:29.448 --> 02:29.907
Huh?

02:30.407 --> 02:31.867
I pulled some strings for this.

02:31.867 --> 02:32.910
So resourceful...

02:33.911 --> 02:37.414
So, we'll split into the chore team
and the TV reception team.

02:37.456 --> 02:38.457
Listen up.

02:38.457 --> 02:41.835
The chore team mustn't get caught
on camera no matter what.

02:42.294 --> 02:44.296
TV RECEPTION TEAM
BAM

02:44.296 --> 02:45.297
CHORE TEAM
BAM

02:46.256 --> 02:48.676
Now, everyone get to your positions.

02:48.842 --> 02:52.346
Hold on, why did you put me
on the chore team?

02:52.346 --> 02:55.349
This division is exactly
based on the your wishes.

02:55.557 --> 02:58.977
When you are stressed,
you gets especially unapproachable.

03:05.177 --> 03:06.610
By the way, Kitahara.

03:06.864 --> 03:07.656
Huh?

03:08.362 --> 03:11.323
What do you look for in the opposite sex?

03:12.282 --> 03:14.243
It's a bit hard to say, but "the body."

03:14.243 --> 03:16.870
If it's hard to say,
at least hesitate a little!

03:17.589 --> 03:20.457
So besides sexual desire,
what do you value?

03:20.624 --> 03:22.418
Hmm, let's see.

03:23.030 --> 03:24.878
As expected, "boobs," maybe?

03:24.878 --> 03:27.381
That's just rephrasing
how horny you are.

03:27.715 --> 03:30.050
Maybe not feeling tense
when we're together?

03:30.050 --> 03:31.093
Oh.

03:31.260 --> 03:33.637
Also, having her own hobbies.

03:33.637 --> 03:34.392
Yeah.

03:34.513 --> 03:36.890
Or showing me a new world.

03:36.890 --> 03:37.683
I see.

03:38.225 --> 03:40.477
In short, someone who is always around,

03:40.477 --> 03:42.062
has their own hobbies,

03:42.104 --> 03:44.231
or shows you a new world.

03:44.440 --> 03:45.774
Something like that.

03:47.860 --> 03:48.986
Is that me?

03:48.986 --> 03:51.363
We were talking about the opposite sex!

03:51.864 --> 03:53.991
The interview crew is here.

03:54.658 --> 03:57.035
This is Yuichi Ikegoshi-san.

03:57.286 --> 03:58.954
Nice to meet you all.

04:00.289 --> 04:02.458
He does looks like a true celebrity.

04:02.458 --> 04:03.460
Let's see.

04:03.667 --> 04:05.878
That is your type, right?

04:05.878 --> 04:08.005
That was in the past!

04:08.005 --> 04:08.922
Really?

04:08.922 --> 04:09.965
That's right!

04:11.517 --> 04:13.218
It's different now!

04:17.845 --> 04:20.600
Well, let's get back to work.

04:21.810 --> 04:24.188
1 HOUR LATER

04:24.354 --> 04:26.690
2 HOURS LATER

04:26.857 --> 04:29.234
3 HOURS LATER

04:31.945 --> 04:33.322
You're back?

04:34.990 --> 04:36.283
What happened?

04:36.283 --> 04:37.242
Iori.

04:37.743 --> 04:40.746
Actually, when we were diving
just now, Ikegoshi-san...

04:43.624 --> 04:44.750
Oh boy.

04:44.750 --> 04:46.752
It seems he bumped into some coral.

04:46.752 --> 04:49.379
We'll shoot the rest without you, okay?

04:49.379 --> 04:50.380
No way.

04:50.380 --> 04:52.508
A scratch like this is nothing.

04:52.508 --> 04:54.968
The problem is that it
is right on your face.

04:54.968 --> 04:56.720
Just leave the rest to Ai-chan.

04:56.720 --> 04:58.222
I can't do that!

04:58.222 --> 04:59.515
Please.

05:00.140 --> 05:01.934
He's so passionate.

05:01.934 --> 05:04.228
I heard this is the first show
to bear his name.

05:04.436 --> 05:08.065
- Can Cakey's makeup cover it up?
- Might flip into a broadcasting accident.

05:08.065 --> 05:09.024
Watch your mouth.

05:12.486 --> 05:13.570
You there!

05:17.324 --> 05:19.368
W-Why did you suddenly...

05:19.368 --> 05:22.996
Ah, sorry, he's not used to
being around strangers.

05:22.996 --> 05:23.956
Ah, no.

05:23.956 --> 05:25.916
It's my fault for
talking to him immediately.

05:25.916 --> 05:27.960
So, what did you need?

05:27.960 --> 05:30.128
Hmm, this might just work.

05:30.128 --> 05:31.713
Excuse me for a moment.

05:34.633 --> 05:36.927
Producer, what do you think?

05:37.697 --> 05:38.595
Hmm.

05:39.680 --> 05:41.598
If we dye his hair black...

05:41.598 --> 05:43.183
It could work, right?

05:43.350 --> 05:45.060
A stand-in?

05:45.513 --> 05:46.270
Please!

05:46.270 --> 05:49.773
For seven years since debut, I've
been told I have nothing to stand out.

05:49.773 --> 05:50.691
I finally...

05:50.691 --> 05:53.068
finally scored this opportunity!

05:53.068 --> 05:55.445
I want to leave my mark
as the "Diving Idol"!

05:56.071 --> 05:58.240
The diving idol?

05:58.240 --> 06:00.450
That image isn't even
that special anyway.

06:00.450 --> 06:02.077
I think it's cool.

06:02.578 --> 06:04.496
Kouhei, that's what he's saying.

06:04.496 --> 06:05.747
Absolutely not!

06:05.747 --> 06:06.957
That's what he says.

06:07.207 --> 06:08.667
Please help me out.

06:08.667 --> 06:10.294
If you want him to do it...

06:10.711 --> 06:12.838
you'll need a seiyuu's autograph.

06:12.838 --> 06:14.047
A seiyuu's?

06:14.590 --> 06:16.967
How about
Yurika Muranaka-san's autograph?

06:16.967 --> 06:18.343
YURIKA MURANAKA, DOME-CLASS SEIYUU
I'm Yurika Muranaka.

06:18.677 --> 06:22.681
The Dome-class seiyuu,
Yurika Muranaka!?

06:24.308 --> 06:26.643
I won't take the blame if I mess up.

06:26.643 --> 06:28.353
Looks like he agreed to do it.

06:28.812 --> 06:31.356
So there shouldn't be any problems then.

06:31.356 --> 06:33.317
In theory, yes.

06:33.567 --> 06:35.819
But you really should reconsider.

06:35.944 --> 06:37.279
I think so, too.

06:37.446 --> 06:38.614
Why?

06:38.864 --> 06:41.366
- That guy is quite a weirdo.
- That guy is quite a weirdo.

06:41.366 --> 06:42.576
Is that so?

06:42.659 --> 06:43.785
That's a bit...

06:43.785 --> 06:45.370
Are you reconsidering?

06:45.537 --> 06:46.496
Great.

06:46.830 --> 06:48.206
That's a bit...

06:48.206 --> 06:49.708
exactly
what I want.

06:49.708 --> 06:51.710
- Is there a problem with your wording?
- Is there a problem with your wording?

06:51.710 --> 06:52.544
It's fine.

06:52.544 --> 06:54.338
Actually, a
little
weird is better.

06:54.421 --> 06:55.964
I-Is that so?

06:55.964 --> 06:57.799
If you say so, I won't stop you.

06:57.799 --> 06:59.301
Let me just say one last thing.

06:59.635 --> 07:02.387
- We
did
try to warn you!
- We
did
try to warn you!

07:09.269 --> 07:11.271
Please, take him away.

07:11.396 --> 07:13.106
That was quick to regret.

07:13.106 --> 07:16.526
Wait, he might be a bit
like this and that, but...

07:16.777 --> 07:18.070
What the hell did you do?

07:18.070 --> 07:20.864
They said they wanted a shot
of me unzipping my wetsuit.

07:21.198 --> 07:24.534
They meant
just
revealing the chest a little.

07:24.952 --> 07:27.454
You unzipped it
all the way down, didn't you?

07:27.704 --> 07:30.666
You took the job, so keep
your clothes on, you hear me?

07:30.707 --> 07:32.584
That's a tall order, but I'll do my best.

07:32.584 --> 07:36.004
He said that, so why don't we just
shoot the food review?

07:36.004 --> 07:38.006
He just called it "a tall order."

07:38.507 --> 07:40.968
Ikegoshi-san,
you need to go to the hospital.

07:40.968 --> 07:41.718
Right.

07:42.302 --> 07:42.970
Hey, you.

07:44.221 --> 07:46.348
I'm really counting on you.

07:46.348 --> 07:47.891
Ah, leave it to me.

07:47.891 --> 07:49.226
All for the autograph.

07:51.853 --> 07:53.605
Good morning.

07:59.486 --> 08:02.322
I am Ai Takahashi, nice to meet you.

08:02.656 --> 08:04.449
Ah, good morning, Ai-chan.

08:12.207 --> 08:13.875
Such beautiful legs.

08:13.875 --> 08:15.127
Such a small face.

08:16.461 --> 08:18.255
Is there any way to make a move on her?

08:18.422 --> 08:20.007
Stop talking nonsense.

08:20.007 --> 08:22.426
You have no chance
of getting her attention.

08:22.592 --> 08:24.594
At least let me dream.

08:25.929 --> 08:28.098
Don't strip in front of the camera
and get arrested!

08:28.098 --> 08:30.017
Tell that to this shirt.

08:30.017 --> 08:31.226
You're blaming the shirt?

08:31.226 --> 08:32.144
Seriously.

08:32.602 --> 08:34.438
Kouhei, wait a moment.

08:35.355 --> 08:37.441
Ikegoshi-san, good morning.

08:38.191 --> 08:39.401
Hey, answer her.

08:39.484 --> 08:40.318
Good morning.

08:40.569 --> 08:42.821
Is this your friend, Ikegoshi-san?

08:42.821 --> 08:43.989
Not at all.

08:43.989 --> 08:46.950
No, I'm an employee
at this diving shop.

08:47.117 --> 08:49.411
Oh, from the diving shop?

08:49.578 --> 08:51.705
If it's possible...

08:52.539 --> 08:55.667
when you're free, could you
show me around somewhere?

08:57.878 --> 08:58.587
Huh?

08:59.046 --> 09:00.547
Me?

09:00.547 --> 09:01.089
Yes.

09:01.089 --> 09:03.050
I don't visit a tropical island often,

09:03.050 --> 09:05.719
so I want to enjoy the beach
before heading back.

09:07.345 --> 09:08.430
Is that so?

09:08.430 --> 09:09.097
Huh?

09:09.514 --> 09:11.058
For real!?

09:11.767 --> 09:13.018
A tropical island...

09:13.018 --> 09:14.478
The open sea...

09:14.478 --> 09:18.106
A person who's from the opposite sex
in a fully unfamiliar land!

09:18.690 --> 09:20.901
This is the opportunity of a lifetime!

09:21.234 --> 09:23.695
Of course! If you don't mind, I'd love to.

09:23.695 --> 09:26.281
Oh, thank you so much.

09:26.990 --> 09:28.408
I'm not going.

09:29.951 --> 09:31.411
Don't be stubborn!

09:31.578 --> 09:32.746
Do it for my sake!

09:32.829 --> 09:33.955
I refuse.

09:34.456 --> 09:36.875
Help me out for once, would you?!

09:36.875 --> 09:38.794
Shut up and die.

09:38.794 --> 09:41.838
I see. Ikegoshi-san can't go.

09:41.838 --> 09:43.256
Ah no, um, about that...

09:43.507 --> 09:45.592
If so, then it'll
just
be you and me.

09:46.927 --> 09:48.637
R-Really?

09:49.221 --> 09:49.888
Yeah.

09:49.888 --> 09:51.765
We're starting the actual shoot.

09:51.932 --> 09:54.476
Let's talk about it later then.

09:54.559 --> 09:56.269
Awesome!

09:56.520 --> 09:57.938
Hold on, Kouhei...

09:58.063 --> 09:59.231
Ikegoshi-san.

09:59.606 --> 10:00.232
Huh?

10:00.440 --> 10:02.400
I borrowed this, put it on.

10:02.400 --> 10:04.277
With this, the front won't open.

10:04.277 --> 10:06.738
Remember,
you must always keep your clothes on!

10:06.738 --> 10:08.115
I know.

10:10.283 --> 10:12.331
Who do you think I am?

10:14.621 --> 10:16.540
Alright, let's start rolling.

10:17.499 --> 10:19.459
Ready, start!

10:19.459 --> 10:21.419
Cut!

10:21.920 --> 10:23.713
Why did it turn out like this?

10:23.713 --> 10:25.590
Just being myself results in this.

10:25.590 --> 10:27.467
We don't need a character like that!

10:27.968 --> 10:29.261
Ikegoshi-san?

10:29.386 --> 10:30.512
It's fine.

10:30.595 --> 10:31.847
When eating...

10:32.389 --> 10:34.057
I'll put on a napkin.

10:34.057 --> 10:36.309
The visuals would be
even more deadlier!

10:36.560 --> 10:38.687
I literally warned you!

10:38.770 --> 10:40.981
I was being careful too.

10:41.064 --> 10:43.817
If you were careful,
you could've avoided this!

10:44.526 --> 10:47.154
I'm sorry you had to see
this unsightly scene.

10:47.154 --> 10:48.864
Ah, um...

10:48.864 --> 10:51.116
Did something happen to him?

10:51.116 --> 10:52.701
He never used to do this.

10:52.951 --> 10:56.079
Ah well, actually,
he hit his head pretty hard.

10:56.079 --> 10:56.997
What do you mean?

10:57.372 --> 11:00.417
For us, this is the
most
natural state.

11:00.417 --> 11:02.043
Wait, wait, wait!

11:02.043 --> 11:04.171
A-Are you guys always like this?

11:04.171 --> 11:06.089
At least I'm not.

11:06.298 --> 11:08.967
He must be hallucinating
or something...

11:10.969 --> 11:11.595
Huh?

11:12.804 --> 11:15.307
I forgot to return this to you last time.

11:18.059 --> 11:20.520
This is all just
a complete misunderstanding.

11:21.479 --> 11:22.856
Is that so?

11:22.898 --> 11:24.399
Let's continue shooting.

11:24.524 --> 11:26.526
Ah, I have to go now.

11:26.776 --> 11:30.030
Let's talk later while eating, okay?

11:30.947 --> 11:31.865
I'm sorry.

11:32.032 --> 11:34.367
Something came up for me
all of a sudden today.

11:34.534 --> 11:36.286
Let's go, Ikegoshi-san.

11:36.286 --> 11:36.828
Yeah.

11:40.624 --> 11:42.334
This is all that bastard's fault!

11:42.500 --> 11:45.128
- What is he pouting about?
- This is all that bastard's fault!

11:45.128 --> 11:46.379
Just some stupid stuff.

11:47.714 --> 11:49.925
That bastard!

11:50.717 --> 11:52.969
This grudge...

11:53.136 --> 11:56.473
there's no way I'm letting this slide!

11:56.473 --> 11:58.516
GRAND BLUE DREAMING SEASON 3

11:59.517 --> 12:01.937
Oh, this is amazing!

12:01.978 --> 12:04.773
Such a beautiful scenery.
Words cannot describe it.

12:04.856 --> 12:06.816
Yes, it's just like...

12:07.275 --> 12:09.236
It's just like a tropical island.

12:09.236 --> 12:11.196
Well, this is Palau.

12:11.196 --> 12:12.155
Cut!

12:13.657 --> 12:15.867
Take a look, this is a giant clam.

12:16.451 --> 12:17.869
This crunchy texture,

12:17.869 --> 12:20.789
the flavor is quite delicate
despite its huge size, isn't it?

12:20.789 --> 12:22.499
- What do you think?
- Yeah.

12:23.208 --> 12:24.960
It tastes like clam.

12:25.877 --> 12:27.087
I suppose so.

12:30.465 --> 12:32.550
Huh? Is that it?

12:33.218 --> 12:36.054
This is a mangrove crab. It's very rare!

12:36.554 --> 12:39.557
This slightly bitter taste
will make people addicted.

12:39.641 --> 12:41.142
Yeah, it's bitter.

12:41.393 --> 12:42.644
This is taro.

12:42.644 --> 12:44.771
- Its taste is...
- It tastes like taro.

12:47.607 --> 12:49.317
What a terrible review.

12:49.317 --> 12:51.027
Because it's Kouhei.

12:51.027 --> 12:52.237
Is he nervous?

12:52.696 --> 12:55.115
Y-You love the sea,

12:55.115 --> 12:57.117
so you must know a lot of things, right?

12:57.117 --> 12:58.451
Ah, yes.

12:59.202 --> 13:02.706
Looking at it in reality, the giant clam
is so big that it's quite gross.

13:03.456 --> 13:06.084
Mangrove crabs can also
be eaten in Japan.

13:06.543 --> 13:10.046
The Napoleon fish is ugly.
There isn't a single cute picture of it.

13:10.213 --> 13:12.257
You have to say something good.

13:13.008 --> 13:14.676
Next up is lobster.

13:14.676 --> 13:15.969
Well, it's just shrimp.

13:16.136 --> 13:18.638
The aroma is really
stimulating my appetite.

13:18.638 --> 13:20.307
It smells like grilled shrimp.

13:21.891 --> 13:23.935
Um, do you have any other comments?

13:24.144 --> 13:25.979
REVIEW LIKE IT'S AN ANIME!

13:26.021 --> 13:28.940
This dish is both magnificent
and delicate, just like

13:28.940 --> 13:31.943
the adorably powerful
battle scenes of a magical girl.

13:31.943 --> 13:35.238
And the color change when boiled is
like a transformation sequen-

13:35.238 --> 13:35.989
REVIEW LIKE IT'S A SEIYUU!

13:35.989 --> 13:39.534
This presentation's one that only
a proud master would have done.

13:39.534 --> 13:43.621
Just like Kaya-sama's live concert,
relying on pure talent to win people over,

13:43.621 --> 13:45.332
what a proud menu indeed!

13:45.332 --> 13:46.499
KEEP THAT UP
FOR THE FOOD REVIEW SHOOT!

13:46.872 --> 13:48.040
It tastes like shrimp.

13:48.418 --> 13:49.461
This isn't working.

13:50.003 --> 13:52.047
No choice. Bring that thing out.

13:52.255 --> 13:54.466
It's bat soup and strong alcohol.

13:54.549 --> 13:56.760
We'll definitely get a worthwhile shot.

13:56.885 --> 13:58.094
No, that's...

13:58.094 --> 13:59.304
Better not bring it out.

13:59.721 --> 14:02.140
Now, what will it be this time?

14:02.140 --> 14:04.100
Ack!

14:04.100 --> 14:06.227
Good, nice reaction.

14:06.353 --> 14:07.062
Okay.

14:08.646 --> 14:09.689
I'm fine.

14:09.689 --> 14:12.150
It looks a bit scary
so I was caught off-guard...

14:15.695 --> 14:17.447
Great job, Ai-chan.

14:17.697 --> 14:19.699
And you too, Ikegoshi-san.

14:27.665 --> 14:28.958
Really sorry.

14:29.042 --> 14:30.710
You guys are having trouble, huh?

14:32.138 --> 14:33.380
Need a hand?

14:33.546 --> 14:34.339
- Iori?
- Iori?

14:34.589 --> 14:35.882
Do you have a plan?

14:36.758 --> 14:39.427
No one is more adept at
dealing with him than me.

14:39.928 --> 14:41.054
That's great!

14:41.221 --> 14:41.930
Huh?

14:41.930 --> 14:43.473
At least that's not a lie.

14:43.640 --> 14:45.183
Then lend me that.

14:45.266 --> 14:46.267
The earpiece?

14:47.060 --> 14:48.561
Will you direct him some more?

14:48.770 --> 14:51.022
It's so big. It'll get caught on camera.

14:51.731 --> 14:53.400
Just leave it to me.

14:54.192 --> 14:55.443
Let's continue shooting.

14:55.902 --> 14:56.945
Yes.

14:56.945 --> 14:59.489
I hid the earpiece like you said.

14:59.823 --> 15:00.990
Is this fine?

15:00.990 --> 15:01.658
Yeah.

15:02.534 --> 15:05.161
I want him to look
a bit more satisfied while eating.

15:05.370 --> 15:07.163
Let me give it a try.

15:07.497 --> 15:09.374
Kouhei, eat it like it's heaven.

15:09.874 --> 15:11.209
I don't think he hears it.

15:11.292 --> 15:12.460
That won't do then.

15:12.794 --> 15:13.586
Right.

15:13.795 --> 15:15.422
Normally he wouldn't hear it.

15:15.422 --> 15:17.173
Because the volume is very low.

15:17.173 --> 15:18.466
Then this is pointless.

15:18.675 --> 15:21.094
That's when this comes into play.

15:23.096 --> 15:24.139
Kouhei-kun.

15:26.808 --> 15:27.809
He reacted.

15:28.017 --> 15:28.977
This voice...

15:28.977 --> 15:29.894
Could it be...

15:29.894 --> 15:32.647
That's right.
It's Kaya Mizuki-san's voice.

15:33.398 --> 15:36.693
If it's her voice, no matter how low
the volume is, he'll hear it.

15:36.818 --> 15:39.028
That's his special power.

15:39.028 --> 15:40.697
Ah, he's looking around.

15:40.697 --> 15:41.990
We have to stop him.

15:42.615 --> 15:43.491
Let me handle it.

15:43.491 --> 15:44.367
MIZUKI KAYA 001-005

15:44.492 --> 15:46.953
Kouhei-kun, don't look this way.

15:47.912 --> 15:49.289
He calmed down.

15:50.540 --> 15:52.667
And next is...

15:52.834 --> 15:55.086
I cooked that dish.

16:00.967 --> 16:02.093
Ah um...

16:02.260 --> 16:02.969
So tasty!

16:03.511 --> 16:04.012
Huh?

16:04.762 --> 16:05.722
It's so delicious!

16:05.847 --> 16:08.433
Never has a dish brought
such peak happiness!

16:08.558 --> 16:10.643
Like heavenly nectar,
it's almost addictive.

16:10.643 --> 16:13.146
A flavor as alluring
as a fairy descending to earth,

16:13.146 --> 16:15.982
blending with the tropical atmosphere
to create a wonderful symphony.

16:15.982 --> 16:19.027
Even the word "perfect match"
isn't enough to describe it!

16:19.027 --> 16:20.445
Yes... exactly!

16:20.612 --> 16:23.531
Did you edit Maya-san's voice
to create this?

16:23.531 --> 16:26.159
I thought that things
would turn out this way.

16:26.326 --> 16:28.786
Normally no one could predict that.

16:29.329 --> 16:31.080
Is acting like this okay?

16:31.080 --> 16:32.457
Please keep that up.

16:32.540 --> 16:33.666
Understood.

16:33.958 --> 16:36.211
Leave it all to me.

16:36.794 --> 16:37.921
Kouhei-kun.

16:37.921 --> 16:40.048
Is the wine delicious?

16:40.798 --> 16:41.508
Yes.

16:41.508 --> 16:44.469
This wine feels smooth like
silk gliding on the tongue,

16:44.469 --> 16:46.679
along with a fruity aroma
much like peaches.

16:47.263 --> 16:49.182
Yes, I think so too.

16:49.516 --> 16:50.850
Great job, Iori.

16:50.850 --> 16:51.684
No sweat.

16:52.018 --> 16:54.521
I thought you're taking
this chance to get revenge.

16:54.521 --> 16:56.231
What are you talking about?

16:57.982 --> 16:59.234
Die!

16:59.234 --> 16:59.984
Huh?

17:00.109 --> 17:01.110
Kouhei-kun.

17:02.028 --> 17:03.530
Yes, Kaya-sama.

17:04.280 --> 17:06.199
I have a favor to ask.

17:06.574 --> 17:07.575
That seashell,

17:07.867 --> 17:08.910
could you eat it?

17:10.703 --> 17:12.997
Ikegoshi-san!

17:13.039 --> 17:14.457
What's with him all of a sudden?

17:14.457 --> 17:15.875
What did you get him to do?!

17:15.875 --> 17:17.544
This is all for some decent shots!

17:17.544 --> 17:19.504
You just said "Die," didn't you!?

17:19.504 --> 17:20.505
Kouhei-kun.

17:20.713 --> 17:23.007
Let's drink the Spirytus too.

17:23.508 --> 17:24.968
I'll drink the Spirytus!

17:24.968 --> 17:26.427
What is wrong with you?

17:26.427 --> 17:27.679
I'm not done yet!

17:27.679 --> 17:28.846
Wait, Iori!

17:28.846 --> 17:30.098
Stop this right now!

17:30.098 --> 17:33.518
Try doing a triple flip
and jumping down from there.

17:33.518 --> 17:34.686
One, two, three... Up!

17:39.357 --> 17:40.483
This is weird.

17:40.483 --> 17:41.693
Something is off.

17:41.693 --> 17:43.361
Everything is going wrong!

17:43.528 --> 17:44.696
Kouhei-kun.

17:45.655 --> 17:46.990
Trust me.

17:47.156 --> 17:49.033
Everything is under control!

17:49.158 --> 17:51.536
This is going to ruin the entire shoot.

17:56.082 --> 17:57.584
Hey, this is bad.

17:58.167 --> 17:59.085
What do we do?

18:00.336 --> 18:01.296
Let's use this.

18:02.964 --> 18:04.424
Ah, that's...

18:06.968 --> 18:08.469
Ai-chan, run!

18:08.636 --> 18:09.596
It's dangerous!

18:09.596 --> 18:11.472
What...

18:11.973 --> 18:13.016
have I done?

18:13.016 --> 18:13.850
Step back!

18:17.687 --> 18:19.314
- Kouhei!
- Got it.

18:32.285 --> 18:33.369
Are you okay?

18:33.745 --> 18:35.204
Ah, yes...

18:38.875 --> 18:40.209
That's good then.

18:43.963 --> 18:46.674
As expected of someone
used to flammable alcohol.

18:46.674 --> 18:49.177
For the first time,
I'm glad you're here.

18:49.344 --> 18:51.846
Couldn't you compliment me
more properly?

18:53.431 --> 18:54.641
Ikegoshi-san.

18:54.641 --> 18:55.391
What is it?

18:56.184 --> 18:57.852
Your friend...

18:58.686 --> 19:00.688
is really dependable, isn't he?

19:06.486 --> 19:08.237
Alright, let's resume shooting.

19:09.113 --> 19:10.239
Ready!

19:10.782 --> 19:11.491
Start...

19:11.491 --> 19:14.077
Cut!

19:14.829 --> 19:16.996
We're back.

19:17.497 --> 19:19.248
Welcome back, how did it go?

19:19.540 --> 19:20.792
It was a disaster.

19:20.792 --> 19:24.045
At least Ikegoshi-san was very excited.

19:24.504 --> 19:27.715
I heard you guys managed to shoot
some unpredictable footage?

19:28.257 --> 19:30.635
He'll probably faint when it airs.

19:30.635 --> 19:31.344
Oh wow.

19:31.344 --> 19:33.429
This is all your fault!

19:33.429 --> 19:34.597
It's entirely baseless!

19:34.597 --> 19:36.391
Listen to this, Maki-san.

19:36.391 --> 19:37.517
What is it?

19:37.934 --> 19:40.895
This guy's naked body ruined my date!

19:40.895 --> 19:42.730
Huh? What're you talking about?

19:43.189 --> 19:46.234
Not just once, but twice!

19:46.818 --> 19:47.777
Hey, Chisa.

19:47.777 --> 19:49.862
- Huh?
- What date?

19:49.862 --> 19:51.531
Oh, you haven't heard?

19:52.115 --> 19:54.534
That lady asked Iori to show her around.

19:54.534 --> 19:55.076
Huh?

19:55.535 --> 19:58.454
But it seems it got canceled
because of Imamura-kun.

19:58.621 --> 20:00.456
I-Is that so?

20:00.498 --> 20:01.874
Are you sighing in relief?

20:02.125 --> 20:03.292
N-Not at all.

20:03.626 --> 20:06.337
I warned him so much,
but he deliberately ignored it.

20:06.587 --> 20:08.756
I was just stripping normally.

20:08.756 --> 20:11.217
What part of that is normal!?

20:11.217 --> 20:13.886
Even I wouldn't dare to strip
if I were told off that much!

20:13.886 --> 20:16.597
And yet... And yet...

20:16.764 --> 20:18.766
You bastard, you did it
on purpose, didn't you!?

20:19.058 --> 20:20.727
Alright, alright, stop arguing.

20:21.617 --> 20:22.660
What's wrong?

20:24.021 --> 20:25.022
Nothing.

20:25.314 --> 20:27.066
Hurry up and clean.

20:29.444 --> 20:32.196
Balance zeroed! Interface vanished!

20:32.655 --> 20:34.657
With just a wave of my magic wand...

20:34.949 --> 20:37.535
I transform into Magical Girl Lalako!

20:40.189 --> 20:40.791
Kouhei.

20:45.058 --> 20:46.310
Oh, Cakey.

20:46.335 --> 20:47.962
Weren't you asleep?

20:48.212 --> 20:50.423
I had something I wanted to ask.

20:50.757 --> 20:52.592
Me?

20:53.426 --> 20:56.220
It's nothing big, really.

20:57.305 --> 21:00.433
Today, why did you interfere with Iori?

21:02.377 --> 21:03.584
What are you on about?

21:04.437 --> 21:06.898
In any case, it was way too abnormal.

21:06.898 --> 21:09.567
Getting warned that much
and yet you're still stripping?

21:10.109 --> 21:13.321
Did you think I stripped to stop his date?

21:13.488 --> 21:14.947
Yeah, isn't that right?

21:14.947 --> 21:19.327
Well, seeing Kitahara happy
is really an eyesore.

21:21.037 --> 21:22.747
Just so you know.

21:24.165 --> 21:27.627
What you asked yesterday
was really just a misunderstanding.

21:28.169 --> 21:33.007
T-Though it's partly my fault for acting
in a way that made you think that.

21:33.007 --> 21:33.674
Yeah.

21:33.800 --> 21:36.761
The atmosphere of the tropical island
got me pretty excited.

21:36.761 --> 21:40.139
You do some pretty weird things
because you're in high spirits, huh?

21:40.848 --> 21:43.601
I've done plenty of stupid things before!

21:43.601 --> 21:44.977
I guess so, you idiot.

21:44.977 --> 21:45.895
Leave me alone!

21:47.104 --> 21:48.314
I'm going to sleep.

21:48.397 --> 21:49.190
Good night.

21:49.190 --> 21:49.857
Yeah.

21:54.529 --> 21:55.738
Seriously.

21:56.739 --> 21:59.075
What an idiot.

22:09.085 --> 22:11.295
The fact that you have a crush on him...

22:11.745 --> 22:13.706
is painfully obvious, even to me.

22:19.637 --> 22:21.264
3... 2... 1... Go!

22:30.815 --> 22:33.568
A sweet little love story!?

22:33.568 --> 22:36.320
Asymmetrical reflection in the mirror

22:36.320 --> 22:37.947
A shattered, crunchy heart

22:37.947 --> 22:39.991
Oh oh, stumbling around

22:40.575 --> 22:42.994
Oh oh, just acting on instinct

22:42.994 --> 22:46.956
Diving deep into my subconscious

22:46.956 --> 22:48.708
Tumbling and falling down

22:48.708 --> 22:51.294
A limit-breaking paradise

22:51.294 --> 22:52.545
Viva, cheers

22:52.545 --> 22:54.005
Everyone, cheers

22:54.005 --> 22:56.048
We're in trouble, we're in trouble

22:56.048 --> 22:56.757
Big trouble

22:56.757 --> 22:58.759
We're in trouble, we're in trouble

22:58.759 --> 22:59.594
Wa wa wa

22:59.594 --> 23:01.554
We're in trouble, we're in trouble

23:01.554 --> 23:02.263
Wa wa wa wa

23:02.263 --> 23:04.223
Let's go, everybody

23:04.223 --> 23:07.685
Dramatic just like a rainbow

23:07.685 --> 23:10.688
Your troubled smile
is absolutely priceless

23:10.688 --> 23:15.985
Total chaos
getting kissed by an octopus

23:15.985 --> 23:18.738
A mermaid washed up on the shore

23:18.738 --> 23:21.657
Darling drowned down
in the Dragon Palace

23:21.657 --> 23:26.954
The treasure box is just full of alcohol

23:26.954 --> 23:29.665
The ultimate license of our youth

23:29.665 --> 23:32.627
Find the treasure and checkmate

23:32.627 --> 23:37.840
An angel who overslept
from swimming too much

23:37.840 --> 23:39.300
Let's go, everybody

23:39.300 --> 23:40.676
Viva, cheers

23:40.676 --> 23:42.011
Oh yeah

23:42.011 --> 23:43.679
Viva, cheers
